 "notes": "Landscape-only pass (buildings/walls skipped). Views: Yandex z18 overview (+2x CSS magnified corners) and 3 z19 close views (school W/N + river channel; NE apartment yards; school S + Tartuga centre). School No.61 grounds (x 550-690, y -108..50): open bare dirt traced as one yard/soil polygon (NOTE: 06_zone_partition maps yard+soil to Lawn, so this open dirt school ground will render green unless that rule is relaxed for non-tree dirt); inside it: asphalt tennis court (577-607, 26-38, matches OSM), dark-green turf mini-pitch (612-642, -3..42, matches OSM 'multi'), beige sand/clay court with light frame (632-655, -10..-44, traced sport/soil, surface uncertain), worn dirt arc track (dirt footpath), paved W walkway (3.5 m) from the N building corner to the S building apron, paved E walkway (4 m) from apron to the E gate/street. Concrete apron around the S school building traced in 2 pieces (its inner courtyard lawn 592-621,-14..-24 left out). N forecourt of the main school building (572-600, 78-100) asphalt. Model red playground at ~(600,25) has NO equipment (bare dirt) -> not a playground; dirt polygon covers it. NE apartments: 13 m asphalt driveway/yard S of the long block (model has only a footpath) -> asphalt yard + 6 m alley line; cars nose-in along it (2 parking strips); lane SE between the diagonal block and the square block (car on it) -> alley 4.5 m; yard lot SE of the diagonal block with scattered cars -> parking. SE: parking lot between the two blocks E of the street (701-750, -93..-116, cars; imagery roofs lean ~5 m S/E of model footprints). Tartuga centre S of the school fence: terracotta-paved courtyard + tree-lined pedestrian strip (plaza paving); large asphalt yard with scattered trees and only 2 cars (yard, not parking; this overrides the OSM/model parking strip at x 657-666 where no cars are visible; model also has a building ~(676,-100) that is open asphalt in imagery and Private_Plot at ~(690,-120)). RIVER: the Ala-Archa concrete channel 